  headline: 'The Ursa Major Family: The Great Bear and Its Neighbours',
  description: 'Guide to the Ursa Major family of constellations — Ursa Major, Ursa Minor, Draco, Boötes, Canes Venatici, Coma Berenices and more. The Big Dipper, Polaris, and the northern sky’s central patterns.',
